yle=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;[External]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;OTLP traces + metrics&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#999999;strokeColor=#8a8a8a;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="60" width="280" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="con-host" value="&lt;b&gt;Host machine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;[External]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;sysctl, vm_stat, pmset, ps&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#999999;strokeColor=#8a8a8a;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1570" y="60" width="280" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="con-b" value="pkpipe (single machine; launchd keeps serve and the MCP servers alive)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#444444;dashed=1;verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingBottom=6;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="230" width="1850" height="910" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="con-cli" value="&lt;b&gt;pkpipe CLI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;[Python process]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;run, runs, eval, doctor, candidates, validate: same core and adapters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace&#x27;&gt;pkpipe.cli&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#438dd5;strokeColor=#3c7fc0;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="280" width="320" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="con-app" value="&lt;b&gt;pkpipe app (pkpipe serve :8787)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;[Python: FastAPI, LangGraph, APScheduler]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;REST + HTMX UI, app MCP (/mcp), scheduler, flow runs, session plans, secure fetch steps, output guard + local classifiers, system preflight, publish gate, OTel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:10px;font-family:monospace&#x27;&gt;pkpipe.serve · pkpipe.app · pkpipe.api · pkpipe.engine · pkpipe.steps&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#438dd5;strokeColor=#3c7fc0;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="270" width="760" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="con-guards" value="&lt;b&gt;Guard models&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;[local weights, transformers]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;Qwen3Guard-Gen-0.6B + ProtectAI DeBERTa, in-process, offline&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=10;fillColor=#438dd5;strokeColor=#3c7fc0;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="280" width="290" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="con-db" value="&lt;b&gt;App DB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;[SQLite (WAL)]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;runs, config snapshots, checkpoints, jobs, drafts, publishes, audit, item events&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=10;fillColor=#438dd5;strokeColor=#3c7fc0;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="500" width="320" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="con-cfg" value="&lt;b&gt;Config&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27;&gt;[git: JSON + Markdown]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;public pack + private overlay: flows, categories, sessions, contexts, security logs&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=10;